; NLightning accounting export, financial book (hledger journal, amounts in millisatoshi, costs in USD)
commodity 1. msat
commodity 1.00 USD
account assets:lightning:channels
account assets:onchain:wallet
account equity:fiat-rounding
account equity:opening-balances
account equity:transfers:in
account equity:transfers:out
account expenses:fees:funding
account expenses:fees:routing
account expenses:fees:withdraw
account expenses:payments
account expenses:unclassified
account income:gains:realized
account income:routing
account income:sales

